        "polymorph",
        "transmutation"
      ],
      "entries": [
        "Il'setsya infuses her next spell with roiling currents of chaos. If Il'setsya Casts a Spell before her turn is over and the spell affects a creature, that creature is also subject to a warpwave (see the sidebar on page 81). If she doesn't Cast a Spell before the beginning of her next turn, this action is wasted."
      ]
